{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本Mister Donut推出番薯冬甩</p><p>日本Mister Donut秋季定番「さつまいもド」（番薯冬甩）於2026年9月2日起期間限定發售。今年迎來第8年，麵體加入1.3%番薯粉，並加厚造型，做成3顆番薯相連的可愛外觀，主打更鬆軟、更「番薯」的口感。</p><p>5款口味</p><p>今次共5款口味，包括原味、石烤番薯風、焦香布甸、濃郁鹹忌廉、以及濃郁番薯泥。當中焦糖布甸番薯冬甩加上卡士達醬與脆焦糖層，口感豐富；濃郁番薯冬甩泥擠滿番薯泥餡後烘烤，番薯味最濃。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825681916932396_7031937266a96a2338b067.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825682084777127_8910682246a96a2355fa33.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825682340429479_12540950866a96a2382560c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825682589112258_18827328966a96a23a46e75.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825682753781406_11473573256a96a23c0ecf1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825682932369944_9649517776a96a23dd89e9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825683150511796_16617124206a96a24068e2a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178825683515782829_12273919436a96a2439209f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T10:20:39.997729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}